---
/** D1: the AID pipeline. Drawing and text equivalent carry the same steps. */
import Diagram from '../Diagram.astro';
const id = 'pipeline';
const arrow = `url(#dg-${id}-arrow)`;
---
<Diagram id={id} width={400} height={720}
  title="The AID pipeline"
  desc="AID starts with a one-time setup and, on an existing codebase, a Knowledge Base build. Work then reaches /aid-execute by the full path of separate phases or by a shortcut that plans the work in one run. Deploy and Monitor are optional steps after Execute."
  caption="How a piece of work moves through AID, from setup to delivery.">
  <rect class="dg-node dg-accent" x="72" y="16" width="160" height="40" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="152" y="41" text-anchor="middle">/aid-config</text>
  <path class="dg-edge dg-optional" d="M152 56 V72" marker-end={arrow} />
  <path class="dg-edge dg-optional" d="M72 36 H40 V136 H64" />

  <rect class="dg-node dg-optional" x="72" y="72" width="160" height="48" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="152" y="92" text-anchor="middle">/aid-discover</text>
  <text class="dg-note" x="152" y="110" text-anchor="middle">(existing code only)</text>
  <path class="dg-edge dg-optional" d="M232 96 H256" marker-end={arrow} />
  <rect class="dg-node dg-optional" x="256" y="72" width="136" height="48" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="324" y="92" text-anchor="middle">/aid-housekeep</text>
  <text class="dg-note" x="324" y="110" text-anchor="middle">(when drifted)</text>

  <path class="dg-edge" d="M152 120 V136" />
  <path class="dg-edge" d="M152 136 H64 V216" marker-end={arrow} />
  <path class="dg-edge" d="M152 136 H320 V216" marker-end={arrow} />

  <rect class="dg-node dg-optional" x="120" y="152" width="160" height="48" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="200" y="172" text-anchor="middle">/aid-triage</text>
  <text class="dg-note" x="200" y="190" text-anchor="middle">(if unsure) suggests</text>
  <path class="dg-edge dg-optional" d="M120 176 H96 V216" marker-end={arrow} />
  <path class="dg-edge dg-optional" d="M280 176 H304 V216" marker-end={arrow} />

  <rect class="dg-node dg-accent" x="8" y="216" width="144" height="40" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="80" y="241" text-anchor="middle">/aid-describe</text>
  <path class="dg-edge" d="M80 256 V280" marker-end={arrow} />
  <rect class="dg-node dg-accent" x="8" y="280" width="144" height="40" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="80" y="305" text-anchor="middle">/aid-define</text>
  <path class="dg-edge" d="M80 320 V344" marker-end={arrow} />
  <rect class="dg-node dg-accent" x="8" y="344" width="144" height="40" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="80" y="369" text-anchor="middle">/aid-specify</text>
  <path class="dg-edge" d="M80 384 V408" marker-end={arrow} />
  <rect class="dg-node dg-accent" x="8" y="408" width="144" height="40" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="80" y="433" text-anchor="middle">/aid-plan</text>
  <path class="dg-edge" d="M80 448 V472" marker-end={arrow} />
  <rect class="dg-node dg-accent" x="8" y="472" width="144" height="40" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="80" y="497" text-anchor="middle">/aid-detail</text>

  <rect class="dg-node" x="256" y="216" width="128" height="40" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="320" y="241" text-anchor="middle">/aid-&lt;verb&gt;</text>
  <path class="dg-edge" d="M320 256 V280" marker-end={arrow} />
  <rect class="dg-node dg-accent" x="256" y="280" width="128" height="56" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="320" y="304" text-anchor="middle">Shortcut<tspan x="320" dy="1.25em">engine</tspan></text>

  <path class="dg-edge" d="M80 512 V532 H152 V552" marker-end={arrow} />
  <path class="dg-edge" d="M320 336 V532 H248 V552" marker-end={arrow} />
  <rect class="dg-node dg-accent" x="120" y="552" width="160" height="40" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="200" y="577" text-anchor="middle">/aid-execute</text>

  <path class="dg-edge dg-optional" d="M160 592 V608 H100 V624" marker-end={arrow} />
  <path class="dg-edge dg-optional" d="M240 592 V608 H300 V624" marker-end={arrow} />
  <rect class="dg-node dg-optional" x="24" y="624" width="152" height="56" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="100" y="648" text-anchor="middle">/aid-deploy</text>
  <text class="dg-note" x="100" y="666" text-anchor="middle">(optional)</text>
  <rect class="dg-node dg-optional" x="224" y="624" width="152" height="56" rx="6" />
  <text class="dg-label" x="300" y="648" text-anchor="middle">/aid-monitor</text>
  <text class="dg-note" x="300" y="666" text-anchor="middle">(optional)</text>

  <path class="dg-edge dg-optional" d="M376 652 H392 V192 H280" marker-end={arrow} />
  <path class="dg-edge dg-optional" d="M392 236 H384" marker-end={arrow} />
  <rect class="dg-label-bg" x="296" y="556" width="92" height="40" />
  <text class="dg-note" x="384" y="572" text-anchor="end">bugs, change<tspan x="384" dy="1.25em">requests</tspan></text>

  <ol slot="text">
    <li>Set AID up once with <code>/aid-config</code>.</li>
    <li>On an existing codebase, build the Knowledge Base with <code>/aid-discover</code>.</li>
    <li>Choose a path. If you are not sure, <code>/aid-triage</code> suggests one; it writes nothing.
      <ul>
        <li>Full path, for broad, new or unclear work: run <code>/aid-describe</code>, <code>/aid-define</code>, <code>/aid-specify</code>, <code>/aid-plan</code> and <code>/aid-detail</code>, in that order. You approve each phase before the next one starts.</li>
        <li>Shortcut path, for one known change: a shortcut such as <code>/aid-fix</code> runs the shortcut engine, which writes the same plan in one run and stops for your approval.</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>Build and review the planned tasks with <code>/aid-execute</code>.</li>
    <li>Optional: package a release with <code>/aid-deploy</code>, and watch production with <code>/aid-monitor</code>. Monitor sends bugs to <code>/aid-fix</code> and change requests to <code>/aid-triage</code>.</li>
    <li>When the project has drifted, <code>/aid-housekeep</code> re-syncs the Knowledge Base.</li>
  </ol>
</Diagram>
